      "ports_visible": false,
      "shelf_visible": true,
      "label": "The Theme metaclass resolves icons dynamically \u2014 `Theme.iconBorderOn` will look for `border_on` in the `[theme.icons]` section of settings. Let me check how existing icons are registered in the settings defaults.",
